tocols. Also, I am adding the 8% rule for interval volume and never suggesting high-intensity workouts for the first 4-6 weeks of a beginner\'s plan. I also ensure immediate referral to doctors or physiotherapists for reports of acute pain. I\'m now exploring how to feed in the user\'s active calculator state to pre-render the chat state.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create `/server.ts`. This file serves as the main Express backend. It hosts static files or leverages Vite\'s middleware inside development. It also sets up client-side-proxy endpoints like `/api/coach` to interface with the server-side `@google/genai` SDK using `gemini-3.5-flash` as recommended. It embeds the customer\'s current running calculator state (VDOT, VO2Max, HR, current level and active training plan parameters) in the AI prompt instructions to deliver an athletic coach experience."
