  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#050505] text-[#E0E0E0] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center px-8 py-4 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#FF4E00] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,78,0,0.4)]\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-black\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\"/></svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic\\\">VDOT.COACH</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8 items-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-70\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00]\\\">Dashboard</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Planilha</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Zonas</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Hist\303\263rico</a>\\n      <div class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10\\\">Atleta: Ricardo S.</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Grid -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 p-6\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Left Column: Physiological State -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#121212] to-[#080808] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FF4E00] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Capacidade Aer\303\263bica</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center py-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"relative w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"absolute w-full h-full transform -rotate-90\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"64\\\" cy=\\\"64\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" class=\\\"text-white/5\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"64\\\" cy=\\\"64\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" stroke=\\\"#FF4E00\\\" stroke-width=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"377\\\" stroke-dashoffset=\\\"113\\\" class=\\\"drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_#FF4E00]\\\" />\\n            </svg>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter\\\">44.2</span>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[9px] opacity-50 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">VO2 M\303\241x</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-6 w-full flex justify-between px-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">41.8</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">VDOT Atual</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">190</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">FC M\303\241x</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">55</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">FCR</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Zonas de Intensidade (Karvonen)</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z1 Regenerativo</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">135-148 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z2 Aer\303\263bico Low</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">149-161 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70 text-[#FF4E00]\\\">Z3 Limiar</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#FF4E00]\\\">162-174 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z4 VO2 M\303\241x</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">175-184 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z5 Anaer\303\263bico</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-red-500\\\">185+ bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Center Column: Training Plan -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 p-8 flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-8\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black italic tracking-tighter\\\">PLANILHA SUB-21 (5K)</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/40 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Semana 03 de 08 \342\200\242 Ciclo de Carga</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs bg-[#FF4E00]/20 text-[#FF4E00] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#FF4E00]/30 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">N\303\255vel Intermedi\303\241rio</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-3 mb-8\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Seg</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">OFF</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#FF4E00]/30 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Ter</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">8km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] text-[#FF4E00]\\\">5:20/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Qua</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">5x1km I</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] text-blue-400\\\">4:08/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Qui</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">6km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:20/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Sex</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">OFF</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2 text-blue-300\\\">S\303\241b</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold italic\\\">12km L</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:35/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Dom</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">3km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:45/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/50 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Insight do Treinador AI</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-white/90\\\">\\n            \\\"Seu volume total esta semana \303\251 de <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00] font-bold\\\">34km</span>. O volume de tiros (5km) representa <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00] font-bold\\\">14%</span> da carga semanal. Aten\303\247\303\243o: Este valor excede o limite recomendado de 8%. Recomendo estender o aquecimento e o desaquecimento em 2km cada para equilibrar a rela\303\247\303\243o volume/intensidade.\\\"\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Column: Predictions & Stats -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Previs\303\265es de Performance</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">5km (Atual)</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">22:30</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">10km (Equiv)</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">46:42</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">Meia Maratona</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">1:43:24</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">Maratona</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">3:34:55</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-30 mt-6 text-center italic\\\">*Equival\303\252ncia baseada em VDOT 41.8</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FF4E00]/10 to-transparent rounded-3xl border border-[#FF4E00]/20 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FF4E00] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Alertas de Seguran\303\247a</h3>\\n        <ul class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4E00] shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">A regra dos <span class=\\\"font-bold text-white\\\">10%</span>: O volume da semana que vem n\303\243o deve exceder <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00]\\\">37.4km</span>.</p>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4E00] shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">Sentindo dor no tend\303\243o? Reduza 40% da intensidade e suspenda tiros de VO2m\303\241x.</p>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">Recupera\303\247\303\243o Ativa: Caminhada 20min ou Bike leve ap\303\263s o treino longo.</p>\\n          </li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"px-8 py-4 bg-white/[0.02] border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n      <span>Status: Sincronizado</span>\\n      <span>Algoritmo: Daniels VDOT v2.4</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\302\251 2024 VDOT Coach \342\200\242 Prescri\303\247\303\243o Segura Ativa</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#050505] text-[#E0E0E0] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center px-8 py-4 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#FF4E00] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,78,0,0.4)]\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-black\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\"/></svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic\\\">VDOT.COACH</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8 items-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-70\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00]\\\">Dashboard</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Planilha</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Zonas</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Hist\303\263rico</a>\\n      <div class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10\\\">Atleta: Ricardo S.</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Grid -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 p-6\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Left Column: Physiological State -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#121212] to-[#080808] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FF4E00] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Capacidade Aer\303\263bica</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center py-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"relative w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"absolute w-full h-full transform -rotate-90\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"64\\\" cy=\\\"64\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" class=\\\"text-white/5\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"64\\\" cy=\\\"64\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" stroke=\\\"#FF4E00\\\" stroke-width=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"377\\\" stroke-dashoffset=\\\"113\\\" class=\\\"drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_#FF4E00]\\\" />\\n            </svg>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter\\\">44.2</span>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[9px] opacity-50 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">VO2 M\303\241x</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-6 w-full flex justify-between px-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">41.8</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">VDOT Atual</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">190</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">FC M\303\241x</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">55</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-40 uppercase\\\">FCR</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Zonas de Intensidade (Karvonen)</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z1 Regenerativo</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">135-148 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z2 Aer\303\263bico Low</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">149-161 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70 text-[#FF4E00]\\\">Z3 Limiar</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#FF4E00]\\\">162-174 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z4 VO2 M\303\241x</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono\\\">175-184 bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium opacity-70\\\">Z5 Anaer\303\263bico</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-red-500\\\">185+ bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Center Column: Training Plan -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 p-8 flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-8\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black italic tracking-tighter\\\">PLANILHA SUB-21 (5K)</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/40 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Semana 03 de 08 \342\200\242 Ciclo de Carga</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs bg-[#FF4E00]/20 text-[#FF4E00] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#FF4E00]/30 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">N\303\255vel Intermedi\303\241rio</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-3 mb-8\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Seg</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">OFF</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#FF4E00]/30 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Ter</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">8km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] text-[#FF4E00]\\\">5:20/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Qua</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">5x1km I</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] text-blue-400\\\">4:08/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Qui</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">6km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:20/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Sex</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">OFF</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2 text-blue-300\\\">S\303\241b</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold italic\\\">12km L</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:35/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Dom</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold\\\">3km E</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-50\\\">5:45/km</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/50 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Insight do Treinador AI</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-white/90\\\">\\n            \\\"Seu volume total esta semana \303\251 de <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00] font-bold\\\">34km</span>. O volume de tiros (5km) representa <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00] font-bold\\\">14%</span> da carga semanal. Aten\303\247\303\243o: Este valor excede o limite recomendado de 8%. Recomendo estender o aquecimento e o desaquecimento em 2km cada para equilibrar a rela\303\247\303\243o volume/intensidade.\\\"\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Column: Predictions & Stats -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Previs\303\265es de Performance</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">5km (Atual)</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold\\\">22:30</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">10km (Equiv)</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">46:42</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">Meia Maratona</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">1:43:24</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs\\\">Maratona</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white/80\\\">3:34:55</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[8px] opacity-30 mt-6 text-center italic\\\">*Equival\303\252ncia baseada em VDOT 41.8</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FF4E00]/10 to-transparent rounded-3xl border border-[#FF4E00]/20 p-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FF4E00] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">Alertas de Seguran\303\247a</h3>\\n        <ul class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4E00] shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">A regra dos <span class=\\\"font-bold text-white\\\">10%</span>: O volume da semana que vem n\303\243o deve exceder <span class=\\\"text-[#FF4E00]\\\">37.4km</span>.</p>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4E00] shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">Sentindo dor no tend\303\243o? Reduza 40% da intensidade e suspenda tiros de VO2m\303\241x.</p>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shrink-0\\\"></div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-snug opacity-80\\\">Recupera\303\247\303\243o Ativa: Caminhada 20min ou Bike leve ap\303\263s o treino longo.</p>\\n          </li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"px-8 py-4 bg-white/[0.02] border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n      <span>Status: Sincronizado</span>\\n      <span>Algoritmo: Daniels VDOT v2.4</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\302\251 2024 VDOT Coach \342\200\242 Prescri\303\247\303\243o Segura Ativa</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
