d layout in `PlanTab.tsx`. Initially, I\'m proposing an adjustment to the column structure, scaling it from 1 to 4 columns. This change promises a more spacious and visually appealing grid. I\'m also assessing the styling of the workout cards to ensure this new layout works well. I\'m paying close attention to the visual spacing and aesthetic of each card within the grid.\n\n\n"
