menting Model Chain Loop**\n\nI\'m now refining the model chain implementation within the `generateContentWithRetry` function. I\'ve switched to a model loop, `modelChain`, where I iterate through available models such as `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, using a `currentModelIndex` for managing retries. I\'m dynamically updating the `params.model` property and now I\'m updating the `isTransient` to handle more types of errors.\n\n\n"
