    summary: "As datas e dist\303\242ncias para as principais maratonas brasileiras em 2026 s\303\243o as seguintes:\n\n**Maratona do Rio 2026**\nA Maratona do Rio de Janeiro ocorrer\303\241 entre os dias 4 e 7 de junho de 2026, aproveitando o feriado de Corpus Christi[1][2][3]. As dist\303\242ncias oferecidas s\303\243o:\n*   **5K**: Quinta-feira, 4 de junho[4][5].\n*   **10K**: Sexta-feira, 5 de junho[4][6][5].\n*   **21K (Meia Maratona)**: S\303\241bado, 6 de junho[4][6][5].\n*   **42K (Maratona Completa)**: Domingo, 7 de junho[4][6][5].\n*   **Desafio**: Uma combina\303\247\303\243o das provas de 21K e 42K[1].\n\n**SP City Marathon 2026**\nA SP City Marathon 2026 est\303\241 agendada para o dia 26 de julho de 2026, um domingo[7][8][9][10][11][12][13][14]. As dist\303\242ncias dispon\303\255veis s\303\243o:\n*   **42.195 km (Maratona)**[10][11].\n*   **21.097 km (Meia Maratona)**[10][11][14].\n\n**Maratona de Porto Alegre 2026**\nA 41\302\252 Maratona Internacional de Porto Alegre ser\303\241 realizada nos dias 30 e 31 de maio de 2026[15][16][17][18][19]. A programa\303\247\303\243o das provas inclui:\n*   **5K e 10K (R\303\272sticas)**: S\303\241bado, 30 de maio[16][17].\n*   **21K (Meia Maratona)**: S\303\241bado, 30 de maio[16][17].\n*   **42K (Maratona Completa)**: Domingo, 31 de maio[16][17].\n*   **Desafio Ga\303\272cho**: Inclui a Meia Maratona e a Maratona[17].\n\nSources:\n[1] [travelrun.com.br](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFOJ-JcMTK_ZfBh2UJAArbdRhzZZhF0UwU-FUrgSq8o7AgQO6fGM1pKMb6Wz6Q4lYFQbMx_zzQfGiHJ1FMHq9kymV0iJOtdeQYV-AiWjGkw1SXFITH6_PVWjU61BD7fyRO5SF7-jxNx5Ycn-XbZZ1b8G7mOa8YGU-g=)\n[2] [www.rj.gov.br](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZdXzpj8_onLOlCJzZrwYgSRU4bkpTV0MWvQF2fHInIck72zdSmf1_OllnPQbB040aK7xMjl5lGwNEwLMLX6M4NP-XawinhP7ppWg2jNyc7OJA4SLDp-tE_melH101CzyfF2P-ZccEJTSEg7e421qScNZ_0q_8pEQsyUsM9-1agZ0YT_eY7Hc-roJCK6SZTM7OD5wZ1H6Xhw==)\n[3] [whereinrio.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3RDKSgVZu0VDB6-eRQ6pEoPDbgUqjmhze_ubgF5ztOvvKttj1VJA5XYGjfEKoP-X6_gzSDJ2O-C5t-eaHbT3W3TPjFvg6WlUaUAD9VsPwERX-5kGkQNfxiQVW2KDGbgXsHDX1OUP3wyG1CYiYohCb21-AhNueDd7LYIZFwY2zKQ-MBO6nF52Xkd19JBq6lN7JlSHVg_9iF1UVXsUKHViZ95Pt)\n[4] [runna.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEr3rVIiiMxbYQOIL8L24H9r-pnwuYqcwa4_E0eTlL0nXbzevtwzgSkx0Tfsfh3q_mOSqGqyrMrriWzoHyFdPxqnsPYMj10DsRK_R73BVJT09Md04VwiV_PbZbdgmzXJV7yvX7fMkwzaI7HBXa39eI=)\n[5] [marathontours.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGot43VDEc5wcsKf8ESnCphSqNulPwVgcIcUN34hTDdO_y3_P58f1qeDgOa3k-O3GQLvu0OWF9VyprvrQhUixmR4mBzUlry544EyN8uBIs0Q_ssfFFYVvHRErH5_lLd9kaCTAJGaqwB_sEHB1Ouc_1k-8_iVrUZAI0y7A==)\n[6] [visitrio.com.br](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGAWI-grDPTL1u4IhYuVQEF8aj-eDWfn20CgZKCtAYsRCur8eECG3Wx6mVG2MjVmYgXUTjoMkXzf7nTTqhsMQr64p8XUVhpJYxQFp7TwQ17dD728c0E8WpY6GTgwtiBo6jgvUqmyFSpLI_5JcyatbY=)\n[7] [sub3-marathon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKZNGSPV-WyEd1GJDZGEUK7oKXMbooa_OyqQg4tX0vl5yhlESptxSbPvIZ0yRqY8fLiDfo1ap7v0yc-0BP1r5Rx9dJNOAdW8_ZpEaoyOmpzkaKwtaJz7SEylBYP3YBqyENB3o3sYqF-h6u)\n[8] [vdoto2.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG1hM0DjVmZBIfEfywinexNN-oKaZAlDB4c4EBM709ha5KOq5fBIB7EcsL5R7IxIzl6k63zBR1P9gfhZjVoBNZoJi31z6Arch4GnVd07iovl8R2_r9509Xk3Qs3FiSTF2ebPRc=)\n[9] [mprassessoria.com.br](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHLWQTS5u_uaVIa4JOtRxnFFLazVIRZHXPJAUFdr5w8r0-cFgT0tkyu1GSvwLiGmq68nh15KcNIkTUqY7LPdwEwyfFNgaCYM0qXYlQcXSPuTqVTydVgfi6PTF4rK8zQ8D1F1ZRR48lZhhx1x0SisL6jT4_3VGboAKTv)\n[10] [esportividade.com.br](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGe9pm07B4RjyP6U3inMkCg1qc_Dv-fgz5Gw1TR94ykRi4vqB2pCZthKGH73x_CVfhcxPOJFXAST6vR04yop5JWyM5AzrxNYCzBD6V2SSKgfiwYHzGwiF4R5RdEz1mhH2mPcb5aSdEZOq4pr10rY__6UPzgCp6UHK868