  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Brazilian Regulations**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the feasibility of incorporating Brazilian regulatory considerations. Specifically, I\'m assessing the implications of displaying detected rides within Brazil, and how to effectively integrate Google search data while maintaining a consistent user interface and user experience. My immediate focus is on ensuring compliance and data integrity within the proposed feature.\n\n\n**Expanding State Coverage**\n\nI\'m now expanding the state coverage in `RacesTab.tsx`. The goal is to overhaul the state dropdown, replacing the limited list with all 26 Brazilian states plus the Distrito Federal, displayed alphabetically or grouped by region, aiming for a more professional appearance. I\'m also refining the procedural city and state detector (`processCustomSearch`) to dynamically create custom race listings with thematic profiles, hints, and relevant links, correcting issues when the state selection changes.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Race Selection**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing race selection based on state. If no search text is entered, the system will now seek or generate an iconic race for the selected state. For example, selecting \"Bahia (BA)\" will display the \"Meia Maratona de Salvador\". I\'m populating the `majorRaces` array with more real races for each Brazilian state to cover more regions. I will also add all Brazilian states to the state dropdown with their correct abbreviations.\n\n\n**Generating Dynamic Circuits**\n\nI\'m now focusing on dynamically generating circuits for each state or city to avoid \"no races found\" messages. The goal is to ensure users are immediately engaged by seeing their location supported with realistic VDOT data from the spreadsheet. I\'m prioritizing the addition of real races to the `majorRaces` array to build an excellent initial geographical coverage.\n\n\n**Analyzing Race Data**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the new race data, specifically focusing on the Amazon region and PA\'s \"Corrida do C\303\255rio.\" I\'m also re-examining the `processCustomSearch` code and the state dropdown to accommodate these additions. The aim is to seamlessly integrate these new races into the `majorRaces` array, and ensure the procedural search handles them correctly, especially considering factors like intense heat and humidity and the offset VDOT. I\'m focusing on clean integration and linting at this stage.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "Irei atualizar o arquivo `RacesTab.tsx` para expandir a lista de corridas oficiais mapeadas de v\303\241rios estados do Brasil (incluindo Nordeste, Norte e Centro-Oeste) e para oferecer uma experi\303\252ncia de busca e filtragem por estados impec\303\241vel para todas as 27 unidades federativas do pa\303\255s. Adicionarei tamb\303\251m intelig\303\252ncia de gera\303\247\303\243o procedimental para qualquer cidade ou estado digitado."
