      replacement_content: "          })}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* \342\232\241 Pliometria & Economia de Corrida Section */}\n      <div id=\"pliometria-science-guide\" className=\"bg-[#0A0A0A] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl space-y-6\">\n        \n        {/* Header with gradient badge */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-4\">\n          <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n            <span className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n              <Zap className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n              Manual Cient\303\255fico de Desempenho\n            </span>\n            <h3 className=\"text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight font-display flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <Sparkles className=\"w-5 h-5 text-vdot-orange\" />\n              Pliometria & Economia de Corrida para Ironman\n            </h3>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-3xl font-sans\">\n              Segredos fisiol\303\263gicos da for\303\247a explosiva el\303\241stica para otimizar a economia de corrida na maratona final de 42km do Ironman.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"bg-[#FF4E00]/10 border border-[#FF4E00]/20 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2 text-right hidden sm:block shrink-0\">\n            <div className=\"text-[9px] text-[#FF4E05]/80 font-black uppercase tracking-wider\">Economia de Corrida</div>\n            <div className=\"text-lg font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400\">+4% a 8%</div>\n            <div className=\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold\">Consumo O\342\202\202 Reduzido</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* 1. O que \303\251 Pliometria & Por que Ironman precisa (Explica\303\247\303\243o Cient\303\255fica) */}\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <h4 className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-vdot-orange flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono\">\n              <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-vdot-orange inline-block\"></span>\n              O que \303\251 Pliometria?\n            </h4>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-350 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n              Pliometria \303\251 um tipo de treino de for\303\247a explosiva que utiliza o <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">Ciclo de Alongamento-Encurtamento (CAE)</strong>. \n              Na pr\303\241tica, s\303\243o exerc\303\255cios com saltos, lan\303\247amentos e impactos controlados, onde o m\303\272sculo primeiro se estica rapidamente \n              (fase exc\303\252ntrica) e depois encurta de imediato (fase conc\303\252ntrica). \n              O objetivo principal \303\251 ensinar o sistema nervoso e os tend\303\265es a se comportarem como <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">molas altamente eficientes</strong>, gerando for\303\247a m\303\241xima no menor tempo poss\303\255vel (pot\303\252ncia reativa).\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <h4 className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-vdot-orange flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono\">\n              <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-vdot-orange inline-block\"></span>\n              Por que um Ironman Precisa Disso?\n            </h4>\n            <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-350 leading-relaxed font-sans space-y-1.5\">\n              <p>Ao contr\303\241rio dos velocistas, o foco para triatletas \303\251 aprimorar a <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">Economia de Corrida (Running Economy)</strong>:</p>\n              <ul className=\"list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-400 text-[11px]\">\n                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Menos consumo de O\342\202\202:</strong> Estudos mostram que o treino pliom\303\251trico reduz o consumo de oxig\303\252nio de 4% a 8% no mesmo ritmo.</li>\n                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Refor\303\247o Tendinoso e \303\223sseo:</strong> Aumenta a rigidez (stiffness) do tend\303\243o de Aquiles, prevenindo fraturas de estresse e tendinites na maratona.</li>\n                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Transi\303\247\303\243o de Postura:</strong> Ajuda a recalibrar os comandos musculares e mec\303\242nicos de corrida ap\303\263s horas na postura est\303\241tica da bike.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* 2. Diagn\303\263stico Din\303\242mico */}\n        <div className=\"bg-amber-950/15 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4\">\n          <div className=\"p-2.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 rounded-lg shrink-0\">\n            <AlertTriangle className=\"w-5 h-5\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"space-y-1 text-left\">\n            <h4 className=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-mono\">\n              Avalia\303\247\303\243o de Carga Neuromuscular (Ex-Sedent\303\241rio a Futuro Ironman)\n            </h4>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-sans leading-relaxed\">\n              Voc\303\252 est\303\241 classificado como n\303\255vel <span className=\"capitalize font-mono font-bold text-white\">{runnerState.level}</span> com <strong className=\"text-white\">{weeksLimit} semanas de atividade consistente</strong>. \n              {recommendedPhase === 1 ? (\n                <span> O algoritmo de seguran\303\247a determina que seu foco deve ser obrigatoriamente a <strong className=\"text-amber-400\">Fase 1: Prepara\303\247\303\243o B\303\241sica e For\303\247a Geral</strong>. Saltos precoces sob fadiga gerada por treinos longos de pedal/corrida s\303\243o a rota direta para fascite plantar e dores tibiais.</span>\n              ) : recommendedPhase === 2 ? (\n                <span> Seu tempo de consist\303\252ncia habilita com seguran\303\247a a <strong className=\"text-amber-400\">Fase 2: For\303\247a Reativa Leve</strong>. Iniciando a rigidez el\303\241stica com baix\303\255ssimo deslocamento vertical.</span>\n              ) : recommendedPhase === 3 ? (\n                <span> Excelente base protetora! Sinta-se confort\303\241vel em realizar a <strong className=\"text-emerald-450 font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fase 3: Pliometria de Baixo Impacto</strong> com treinos de corda r\303\241pidos e focando rigorosamente no sil\303\252ncio de impacto.</span>\n              ) : (\n                <span> Habilitado para a <strong className=\"text-emerald-455 font-semibold text-emerald-400\">Fase 4: Pliometria de Transi\303\247\303\243o Espec\303\255fica</strong> com afundos pliom\303\251tricos r\303\241pidos e treinos unilaterais precisos de manuten\303\247\303\243o.</span>\n              )}\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* 3. Abas de Fase de Pliometria */}\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono\">\n            Phases de Progress\303\243o Segura (Selecione para detalhar)\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2\">\n            {[\n              { id: 1, title: \'1. Base de For\303\247a\', sub: \'3-6 meses obrigat\303\263rios\' },\n              { id: 2, title: \'2. For\303\247a Reativa Leve\', sub: \'2-3 meses de mola\' },\n              { id: 3, title: \'3. Baixo Impacto\', sub: \'Corda / Saltos r\303\241pidos\' },\n              { id: 4, title: \'4. Pliometria Espec\303\255fica\', sub: \'Afundos e Saltos unilaterais\' },\n            ].map((p) => {\n              const isSelected = pliometriaPhase === p.id;\n              const isRec = recommendedPhase === p.id;\n              return (\n                <button\n                  key={p.id}\n                  onClick={() => setPliometriaPhase(p.id)}\n                  className={`flex flex-col items-start p-3 rounded-xl border text-left transition cursor-pointer ${\n                    isSelected \n                      ? \'bg-vdot-orange border-vdot-orange text-black font-extrabold shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,78,0,0.2)]\' \n                      : \'bg-[#121214] border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 hover:bg-white/5 text-slate-350\'\n                  }`}\n                >\n                  <div className=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide font-black truncate w-full flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span>{p.title}</span>\n                    {isRec && (\n                      <span className={`text-[8px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold ml-1 shrink-0 ${isSelected ? \'bg-black/10 text-black\' : \'bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20\'}`}>\n                        Recomendado\n                      </span>\n                    )}\n                  </div>\n                  <div className={`text-[10px] mt-0.5 ${isSelected ? \'text-black/75\' : \'text-slate-500\'}`}>{p.sub}</div>\n                </button>\n              );\n            })}\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Aba Ativa */}\n          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3\">\n            {pliometriaPhase === 1 ? (\n              <div className=\"space-y-2.5\">\n                <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                  <h4 className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase font-display flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <CheckCircle className=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500\" />\n                    Fase 1: Prepara\303\247\303\243o Muscular e For\303\247a Concreta\n                  </h4>\n                  <span className=\"text-[10px] bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold uppercase\">Volume de Impacto: Zero</span>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n                  <strong className=\"text-white\">O que fazer:</strong> Fortalecer a estrutura geral de tend\303\265es, ligamentos e o core sem nenhum tipo de impacto a\303\251reo. Prepare o corpo para aguentar os treinamentos pliom\303\251tricos reais que vir\303\243o no futuro.\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Agachamento Bilateral Livre</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Foco absoluto na descida (fase exc\303\252ntrica) demorando de 3 a 4 segundos, subindo de forma \303\241gil e explosiva. Executar 3 s\303\251ries de 10-12 reps.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Eleva\303\247\303\243o de G\303\252meos no Degrau</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Apoiar as pontas dos p\303\251s no degrau, descer ao m\303\241ximo e subir rapidamente contraindo forte a panturrilha. 3 s\303\251ries de 15 reps controladas.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ) : pliometriaPhase === 2 ? (\n              <div className=\"space-y-2.5\">\n                <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                  <h4 className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase font-display flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <CheckCircle className=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500\" />\n                    Fase 2: For\303\247a Reativa Leve (Molas Ativas)\n                  </h4>\n                  <span className=\"text-[10px] bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold uppercase\">Volume de Impacto: M\303\255nimo</span>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n                  <strong className=\"text-white\">O que fazer:</strong> Movimentos el\303\251tricos r\303\241pidos no pr\303\263prio lugar sem tirar os p\303\251s do ch\303\243o drasticamente. Ensina o c\303\251rebro a aumentar a resposta reativa motora com impacto residual m\303\255nimo.\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Jumping Jacks Suaves</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Polichinelos r\303\241pidos, por\303\251m amortecendo as descidas de forma que o calcanhar encoste minimamente no solo. 3 s\303\251ries de 30-40 segundos.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Skipping Baixo de Cad\303\252ncia</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Corrida estacion\303\241ria tirando apenas a ponta dos p\303\251s do solo a poucos cent\303\255metros. Quadril alto, bra\303\247os coordenados em alta velocidade. 3x30 segundos.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ) : pliometriaPhase === 3 ? (\n              <div className=\"space-y-2.5\">\n                <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                  <h4 className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase font-display flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <CheckCircle className=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500\" />\n                    Fase 3: Pliometria de Baixo Impacto (Impacto Controlado)\n                  </h4>\n                  <span className=\"text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold uppercase\">Contatos: ~30-40 por Sess\303\243o</span>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n                  <strong className=\"text-white\">O que fazer:</strong> Pequenos saltos bilaterais curtos focado na rapidez e no amortecimento. Imagine que o \"ch\303\243o est\303\241 pegando fogo\" para decolar rapidamente a cada sutil contato.\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Salto \303\240 Corda Curto</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Saltos normais de corda subindo apenas 1-2 cm do solo. Concentre em n\303\243o flexionar demais os joelhos e mola do tornozelo. 3 s\303\251ries de 20-30 repeti\303\247\303\265es.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Salto Retido Vertical Contido</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Corpo enrijecido como um l\303\241pis r\303\255gido. Saltar verticalmente usando exclusivamente a elasticidade da panturrilha e p\303\251. 3 s\303\251ries de 6-8 pulos r\303\241pidos consecutivos.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ) : (\n              <div className=\"space-y-2.5\">\n                <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                  <h4 className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase font-display flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <CheckCircle className=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500\" />\n                    Fase 4: Pliometria de Transi\303\247\303\243o Espec\303\255fica\n                  </h4>\n                  <span className=\"text-[10px] bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold uppercase\">Contatos: ~20-30 M\303\241ximo</span>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n                  <strong className=\"text-white\">O que fazer:</strong> Saltos unilaterais avan\303\247ados que copiam a cinem\303\241tica e as passadas da corrida, desenvolvendo rigidez mec\303\242nica m\303\241xima. Use apenas com supervis\303\243o ou se muito avan\303\247ado.\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Afundo Alternado com Salto (Split Jump)</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Troca de pernas \303\241gil no ar com pequeno salto. Aterrar absorvendo de forma suave e controlada. 2 s\303\251ries de 5 saltos por perna.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"bg-[#0c0c0e] p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5\">\n                    <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-vdot-orange font-mono\">Saltos Laterais de Estabilidade</div>\n                    <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\">Salto horizontal de um lado para o outro. Ao apoiar com a perna oposta, estabilize por 2 segundos antes de ejetar de volta. 2 s\303\251ries de 10 contatos totais.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* 4. A T\303\251cnica \303\251 Tudo & Programa\303\247\303\243o Estrat\303\251gica */}\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2\">\n          \n          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <h5 className=\"text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display\">\n              <TrendingUp className=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#FF4E00]\" />\n              Como Aterrar: A T\303\251cnica \303\251 Tudo!\n            </h5>\n            <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans mt-1\">\n              O segredo para transformar articula\303\247\303\265es em molas el\303\241sticas \303\251 reduzir drasticamente o tempo de contato e ru\303\255do com o ch\303\243o:\n            </p>\n            <ul className=\"text-xs text-slate-305 space-y-1.5 mt-2 list-none pl-1\">\n              <li className=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\">\n                <span className=\"text-[#FF4E00] font-mono font-bold\">\342\200\242</span>\n                <span><strong className=\"text-white\">Aterrissagem ativa:</strong> Apoie sempre o ter\303\247o anterior do p\303\251 (metatarso), nunca solte o calcanhar r\303\255gido direto no ch\303\243o.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\">\n                <span className=\"text-[#FF4E00] font-mono font-bold\">\342\200\242</span>\n                <span><strong className=\"text-white\">Joelhos Alinhados:</strong> Evite a rota\303\247\303\243o interna din\303\242mica. Mantenha os joelhos totalmente sim\303\251tricos e alinhados verticalmente com as pontas dos p\303\251s.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\">\n                <span className=\"text-[#FF4E00] font-mono font-bold\">\342\200\242</span>\n                <span><strong className=\"text-white\">Absor\303\247\303\243o Silenciosa:</strong> Seus saltos devem ser totalmente silenciosos. Ru\303\255dos excessivos significam sobrecarga articular sem absor\303\247\303\243o mec\303\242nica eficiente.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <h5 className=\"text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display\">\n              <Calendar className=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#FF4E00]\" />\n              Integra\303\247\303\243o Peri\303\263dica no Ciclo Ironman\n            </h5>\n            <p className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans mt-1\">\n              Organize a pliometria de acordo com o est\303\241gio da sua planilha de 8 semanas para manter o corpo descansado e el\303\241stico:\n            </p>\n            <ul className=\"text-xs text-slate-305 space-y-2 mt-2 list-none pl-1\">\n              <li className=\"border-l-2 border-[#FF4E00] pl-2\">\n                <strong className=\"text-white\">Per\303\255odo de Base:</strong> Foco exclusivo em funda\303\247\303\243o de for\303\247a e quilometragem. <strong className=\"text-amber-500\">Zero pliometria ativa</strong> de saltos.\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"border-l-2 border-[#FF4E00] pl-2\">\n                <strong className=\"text-white\">Per\303\255odo de Constru\303\247\303\243o:</strong> Introdu\303\247\303\243o seletiva (1x por semana). Volume baix\303\255ssimo (20-30 contatos) num dia de treino leve, nunca ap\303\263s treinos longos de corrida.\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"border-l-2 border-[#FF4E00] pl-2\">\n                <strong className=\"text-white\">Per\303\255odo de Pico/Polimento:</strong> Manuten\303\247\303\243o em baixas e r\303\241pida resposta el\303\241stica. Suspenda completamente o impacto <strong className=\"text-amber-500\">2 a 3 semanas antes</strong> da prova alvo.\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Exemplo de Sess\303\243o Pr\303\241tica */}\n        <div className=\"bg-[#FF4E00]/5 border border-[#FF4E00]/15 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1\">\n          <div className=\"font-extrabold text-[#FF4E00] uppercase tracking-wide flex items-center gap-1 font-mono\">\n            <span>\342\232\241 Exemplo de Rotina Pr\303\241tica Recomendada (Para Atletas Habilitados):</span>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"text-slate-300 font-sans leading-relaxed\">\n            Ap\303\263s aquecimento leve com trote e mobilidade de quadril, realize: \n            <strong className=\"text-white\"> 3x20 contatos de cordas</strong> (salto curtinho de 2cm) + \n            <strong className=\"text-white\"> 3x6 saltos de l\303\241pis</strong> (verticais sem dobrar joelhos) + \n            <strong className=\"text-white\"> 2x5 split jumps por perna</strong>. \n            Mantenha intervalo generoso e interrompa o treino imediatamente ao menor sinal de dores tibiais ou tendinosas.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  );\n}"
    }
