        }
        lines {
          text: "        {/* 1. O que \303\251 Pliometria & Por que Ironman precisa (Explica\303\247\303\243o Cient\303\255fica) */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <h4 className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-vdot-orange flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-vdot-orange inline-block\"></span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              O que \303\251 Pliometria?"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </h4>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-350 leading-relaxed font-sans\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Pliometria \303\251 um tipo de treino de for\303\247a explosiva que utiliza o <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">Ciclo de Alongamento-Encurtamento (CAE)</strong>. "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Na pr\303\241tica, s\303\243o exerc\303\255cios com saltos, lan\303\247amentos e impactos controlados, onde o m\303\272sculo primeiro se estica rapidamente "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              (fase exc\303\252ntrica) e depois encurta de imediato (fase conc\303\252ntrica). "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              O objetivo principal \303\251 ensinar o sistema nervoso e os tend\303\265es a se comportarem como <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">molas altamente eficientes</strong>, gerando for\303\247a m\303\241xima no menor tempo poss\303\255vel (pot\303\252ncia reativa)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div className=\"bg-[#050505] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-2\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <h4 className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-vdot-orange flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-vdot-orange inline-block\"></span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Por que um Ironman Precisa Disso?"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </h4>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-350 leading-relaxed font-sans space-y-1.5\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <p>Ao contr\303\241rio dos velocistas, o foco para triatletas \303\251 aprimorar a <strong className=\"text-white font-semibold\">Economia de Corrida (Running Economy)</strong>:</p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <ul className=\"list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-400 text-[11px]\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Menos consumo de O\342\202\202:</strong> Estudos mostram que o treino pliom\303\251trico reduz o consumo de oxig\303\252nio de 4% a 8% no mesmo ritmo.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Refor\303\247o Tendinoso e \303\223sseo:</strong> Aumenta a rigidez (stiffness) do tend\303\243o de Aquiles, prevenindo fraturas de estresse e tendinites na maratona.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <li><strong className=\"text-slate-305 font-semibold text-slate-300\">Transi\303\247\303\243o de Postura:</strong> Ajuda a recalibrar os comandos musculares e mec\303\242nicos de corrida ap\303\263s horas na postura est\303\241tica da bike.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              </ul>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
